window.MG_LAZY_DATA["data/lazy/resources/hpc-v27-045-772ac764f1e97b27.json"]={sha256:"772ac764f1e97b27615ca258dbdb0c989ae73b7c8292f8378bc94438df8fed4d",value:{"sources":[{"id":"v27-case-1fb82481b0978d0f","url":"https://www.opencompute.org/documents/ocp-acf-reference-design-guidance-white-paper-r1-pdf","title":"Data Center Liquid Distribution Guidance and Reference Designs","titleEn":"Data Center Liquid Distribution Guidance and Reference Designs","publisher":"Open Compute Project","scope":"查證具名案例與原理背景。課內數值、故障資料與判準為原創教學假設；請勿當作廠商規格或操作程序。","scopeEn":"Establish named case and principle context. Numbers, fault data, and criteria are original teaching assumptions, not manufacturer specifications or operating procedures."}],"media":{"courses":[{"courseId":"hpc-v27-045","videos":[],"guides":[]}]},"related":{"courses":[{"courseId":"hpc-v27-045","related":[{"id":"hpc-v27-046","referenceUrls":["https://www.opencompute.org/projects/rack-and-power/"],"title":"OCP 電源模組：單失效後的降額容量","titleEn":"OCP power modules: derated capacity after one failure","why":"用兩課的可觀察驗收條件比較模型邊界：交付局部溫度表、含誤差餘裕、凝結/洩漏競爭假說與閾值邊界測例；請同學只使用交付件重算兩組，保留失敗案例與限制；全程使用合成檔案，不對生產系統執行故障。","whyEn":"Compare model boundaries using observable acceptance criteria: Deliver local temperatures, uncertainty-adjusted margins, competing condensation/leak hypotheses and threshold-boundary tests. The exercise does not alter humidity or coolant temperatures on real equipment. Have a peer reproduce both configurations from the artifacts, retaining failed cases and limitations. Use synthetic files throughout; never inject these faults into a production system.","difference":"建立 module_id、rated、derated、domain、load_share 表；以 derated 欄計算，分開正常與單失效兩個狀態。","differenceEn":"Build module identity, rated output, derated output, upstream domain and load-share records. Use derated output for the calculation and keep normal and single-failure states separate.","transfer":"保留單位與邊界條件，僅轉移可證明相容的驗證方法。","transferEn":"Retain units and boundary conditions; transfer only demonstrably compatible verification methods.","practice":["教學凝結餘裕為 Tsurface-Tdew；負值表示模型條件下有凝結風險，正值仍需考慮感測誤差與局部差異；暴露表面 18°C；局部露點由 16°C 升至 19°C，表面溫度固定；數值差使用 K；名義式 18-16 = 2 K margin；變更式 18-19 = -1 K margin。所有數值、限制與門檻為原創合成教學條件；來源支援概念與介面，不代表實機量測或設備規格。","單失效餘裕為 (模組數-1)*每模組可用容量-負載；正值只證明此容量模型，不包含切換瞬態與配電限制；三個模組各可用 3 kW；負載名義 8 kW、變更 5 kW；可用值已含本課所有降額；名義式 (3-1)*3-8 = -2 kW margin after one loss；變更式 (3-1)*3-5 = 1 kW margin after one loss。所有數值、限制與門檻為原創合成教學條件；來源支援概念與介面，不代表實機量測或設備規格。","比較兩個模型的輸入、誤差與驗收條件，記錄不能沿用的假設。"],"practiceEn":["Condensation margin is surface temperature minus dew point. A negative value signals risk under the modeled conditions; a positive value still requires allowance for measurement error and spatial variation. Keep an exposed surface at 18°C while local dew point rises from 16°C to 19°C. Temperature differences are reported in K, and the dew points are given fixture inputs rather than calculated humidity measurements. Nominal 18-16 = 2 K margin; changed 18-19 = -1 K margin. Every numeric input, limit and threshold is an original synthetic teaching condition. References establish concepts and interfaces, not measured machine results or equipment specifications.","Single-failure margin equals (module count-1) times usable module capacity minus load. Positive margin proves this capacity condition only, excluding transfer transients, distribution limits and common failures. Use three modules with 3 kW usable output each. Load changes from 8 to 5 kW; the declared usable value already includes all derating in this fixture. Nominal (3-1)*3-8 = -2 kW margin after one loss; changed (3-1)*3-5 = 1 kW margin after one loss. Every numeric input, limit and threshold is an original synthetic teaching condition. References establish concepts and interfaces, not measured machine results or equipment specifications.","Compare inputs, errors, and criteria; document assumptions that cannot be transferred."]},{"id":"hpc-v27-055","referenceUrls":["https://www.quantum-espresso.org/Doc/INPUT_PW.html"],"title":"Quantum ESPRESSO：平面波截止與可觀測量收斂成本","titleEn":"Quantum ESPRESSO: plane-wave cutoff and observable-convergence cost","why":"用兩課的可觀察驗收條件比較模型邊界：交付局部溫度表、含誤差餘裕、凝結/洩漏競爭假說與閾值邊界測例；請同學只使用交付件重算兩組，保留失敗案例與限制；全程使用合成檔案，不對生產系統執行故障。","whyEn":"Compare model boundaries using observable acceptance criteria: Deliver local temperatures, uncertainty-adjusted margins, competing condensation/leak hypotheses and threshold-boundary tests. The exercise does not alter humidity or coolant temperatures on real equipment. Have a peer reproduce both configurations from the artifacts, retaining failed cases and limitations. Use synthetic files throughout; never inject these faults into a production system.","difference":"使用原創合成資料研究「Quantum ESPRESSO：平面波截止與可觀測量收斂成本」，從物理或資料契約推導計算，並以反例驗證。完成：交付截止掃描表、預估與實際基底欄位、能量差及目標量驗收報告。","differenceEn":"Investigate Quantum ESPRESSO: plane-wave cutoff and observable-convergence cost using an original synthetic fixture. Derive the calculation from its physical or data contract, challenge it with a counterexample, and defend a bounded conclusion. Complete: Deliver a cutoff sweep with separate estimated and actual basis-count columns, observable differences and an acceptance report that records pseudopotential, cell and sampling choices.","transfer":"保留單位與邊界條件，僅轉移可證明相容的驗證方法。","transferEn":"Retain units and boundary conditions; transfer only demonstrably compatible verification methods.","practice":["教學凝結餘裕為 Tsurface-Tdew；負值表示模型條件下有凝結風險，正值仍需考慮感測誤差與局部差異；暴露表面 18°C；局部露點由 16°C 升至 19°C，表面溫度固定；數值差使用 K；名義式 18-16 = 2 K margin；變更式 18-19 = -1 K margin。所有數值、限制與門檻為原創合成教學條件；來源支援概念與介面，不代表實機量測或設備規格。","從動能正比於波向量平方開始，得到半徑正比截止平方根，再以三維球體積推導基底數比例。","比較兩個模型的輸入、誤差與驗收條件，記錄不能沿用的假設。"],"practiceEn":["Condensation margin is surface temperature minus dew point. A negative value signals risk under the modeled conditions; a positive value still requires allowance for measurement error and spatial variation. Keep an exposed surface at 18°C while local dew point rises from 16°C to 19°C. Temperature differences are reported in K, and the dew points are given fixture inputs rather than calculated humidity measurements. Nominal 18-16 = 2 K margin; changed 18-19 = -1 K margin. Every numeric input, limit and threshold is an original synthetic teaching condition. References establish concepts and interfaces, not measured machine results or equipment specifications.","Start from kinetic energy proportional to squared wavevector magnitude, obtain a reciprocal-space radius proportional to the square root of cutoff, then use three-dimensional sphere volume to derive the count ratio without assuming integer equality.","Compare inputs, errors, and criteria; document assumptions that cannot be transferred."]}],"references":[{"id":"v27-case-95d717ba7201260a","url":"https://www.opencompute.org/projects/rack-and-power/","title":"Rack and Power","titleEn":"Rack and Power","publisher":"Open Compute Project","scope":"查證具名案例與原理背景。課內數值、故障資料與判準為原創教學假設；請勿當作廠商規格或操作程序。","scopeEn":"Establish named case and principle context. Numbers, fault data, and criteria are original teaching assumptions, not manufacturer specifications or operating procedures."},{"id":"v27-case-c832e849342e0d24","url":"https://www.quantum-espresso.org/Doc/INPUT_PW.html","title":"Quantum ESPRESSO PW input reference","titleEn":"Quantum ESPRESSO PW input reference","publisher":"Quantum ESPRESSO","scope":"查證具名案例與原理背景。課內數值、故障資料與判準為原創教學假設；請勿當作廠商規格或操作程序。","scopeEn":"Establish named case and principle context. Numbers, fault data, and criteria are original teaching assumptions, not manufacturer specifications or operating procedures."}],"overview":"比較相鄰案例與另一組案例的模型、可量測結果及可轉移的驗證方法。","overviewEn":"Compare neighboring and cross-group cases by model, measurable outcome, and transferable verification method."}]},"places":{"courses":[]},"vendors":{"courses":[],"vendors":[]}}};
